# Headers for the site on Cloudflare (Workers static assets). The build fills {{scripts}} with the hash of every
# script the apps' pages carry (pageScript in src/kit/page.ts), so no other inline script can run, even in a frame.
# The site is its own only source of code and style; nothing may embed the editor. img-src is the site, the picture
# proxy (its origin filled in by scripts/headers.ts: every web picture is fetched through it, docs/network.md) and the
# map's tiles, which OpenStreetMap asks be fetched directly; nothing else. connect-src names the proxy (an export
# fetches a picture's bytes), the short-link service and the places later apps ask (OpenStreetMap, Bluesky,
# Wikipedia); frame-src and media-src allow a thing from the web only in a sandboxed frame made after a tap, as the
# embeds do.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(self), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' {{scripts}}; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: {{media}} https://tile.openstreetmap.org; font-src 'self' data:; media-src https:; connect-src 'self' data: {{media}} https://tile.openstreetmap.org https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org https://tinier.tinylittleoffice.com https://public.api.bsky.app https://*.wikipedia.org; worker-src 'self'; frame-src 'self' about: blob: https:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' mailto:
  Cache-Control: no-cache
# The pages themselves: no-transform, so Cloudflare does not rewrite them to add its analytics beacon (which the
# policy above would block anyway). Only the HTML: the scripts keep their compression.
/
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-transform
/:app/
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-transform
# Built files carry a hash in their name: once fetched, they are never asked for again.
/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/files.json
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
